  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">IMPLEMENTATION OF CIRCULAR ECONOMY PRINCIPLES IN MUNICIPALITIES AND COMPANIES AS A TOOL FOR ACHIEVEMENT OF SUSTAINABLE DEVELOPMENT IN THE REPUBLIC OF SERBIA</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;The specific objective (Outcome) of this contract is to support the business sector, the local-self-government administration and the citizens in the transition from a linear to circular economy which will contribute to a better environmental and climate change status and life quality of citizens in the republic of Serbia.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
